# PULSE: black key 6 hits the kick, 7 the tick; while the clock runs (90 BPM) the kick plays beats 1
# and 3 and the tick the off-beats; over latched drones, no clicks, no clips. STOP: the pattern stops
wait 300
wav pulse.wav
tapkey b5
wait 600
expect kicks 1
tapkey b6
wait 600
expect kicks 1
expect peak_db_min -30
tapkey b0
tapkey b2
wait 1500
tap PLAY
wait 5300
expect kicks >4
expect kicks <8
shot pulse.png
tap PLAY
wait 2000
expect kicks <8
wavstop
expect clips 0
